# Local two-player (game/twoplayer.ts): player 2 joins on player 1's spot and rides the same keys
# from its own input (b2): ollie onto the 0.45 m ledge, BS 50-50 to the end, roll off. The players
# never touch, so they ride it alike tick for tick, and each skater event comes twice, tagged player
# 1 and player 2. Player 1 rides exactly as alone (lab-5050-ledge: 475 at 467). Then player 2 leaves.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
cmd 0 player2 join 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
bot balance
p2 hold up 6..100
p2 hold ollie 90..105
p2 tap grind 176
p2 bot balance
cmd 520 player2 leave
run 560
expect event player2{joined=true} within 1..1
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,player=1} within 177..177
expect event grindStart{trick=BS 50-50,player=2} within 177..177
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50,points=475,player=1} within 467..467
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50,points=475,player=2} within 467..467
expect event comboLanded count == 2
expect skater.score == 475 at 500
expect skater2.score == 475 at 500
expect skater.pos.x > 12.19 at 500
expect skater2.pos.x < 12.2 at 500
expect players == 2 at 520
expect event player2{joined=false} within 521..521
expect players == 1 at end
expect no event bail
